AILABE0 LA36 Printer Diagnostic

The following differences exist between dilab-d
and ailab-e:
0021: 4000 != 0000 / Use software switch register
0022: 0166 != 0566
5275: 0411 != 0111 / AILA
5277: 0204 != 0205 / BE
6260: 0411 != 0111 / AILA
6262: 0204 != 0205 / BE
6553: 5504 != 5501 / -AILAB
6556: 5504 != 0560 / E0
It can be seen that this essentially just a name change.
